      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Personal exeriences: some friends will get upset or bordeline stalkish when I'm online. An option to become invisible (similar to discord) can prevent this!\nI'm usually busy working on avatars or hanging out with my boyfriend (alone)! And it's really creepy when friends/ acquaintances say, \"you were on at 3:05pm yesterday? You weren't sleeping, you were ignoring me.\" yada yada.\nAnd searching users have indications that they're online. I blocked a person a long time ago and they still try to harass me by making alts and spamming friend requests only when I appear online.\nOne more thing, turning off notification invites would be a life saver!\nI get so many spammed at me and they get stuck on the bottom of my screen. I have to manually reject them all and 30% of the time my controller cursor accidentally press the check mark.",
